<Layout title="RIPL Wealth | Build Tomorrow Today" description="Build financial freedom with purpose. RIPL helps business owners, athletes and people building their careers connect their financial lives and investments.">
<section class="hero-home"><div class="hero-copy ripl-ripple" data-motion=""><h1><span class="hero-line">What do you want</span> <span class="hero-line">your money</span> <em class="hero-line">to do for you?</em></h1><p class="lead home-restored-copy">You’ve built a successful business. Let’s bring that same intention to your personal wealth, with a clear plan that connects the two.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/assessment/">Take the Quiz</a><a class="text-link" href="/how-we-work/">See How We Work</a></div><p class="hero-audience">For business owners, athletes, and people building their careers.</p></div><div class="hero-photo"><div class="ripl-photo-frame"><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" alt="The RIPL team together in their Fort Collins office" fetchpriority="high" width="1536" height="1024"></div></div></div></section>


<section class="manifesto"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHO WE WORK WITH</div><h2 class="big-statement">We work with people who are serious about building financial freedom,<br><span>and using it to make a difference for the people around them.</span></h2><div class="manifesto-grid"><p class="lead">The question is how you get there. For us, it starts with building your investment business.</p><div><a class="btn" href="/financial-freedom/">Explore our path to financial freedom</a></div></div></div></section>


<section class="section home-roadmap"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE BIGGER PICTURE</div><div class="questions-head"><h2>Build freedom.<br><span class="ripl-gold">Make an impact.</span></h2><p>Your next dollar, your next hour, your next stage. Start with where you are and build toward what matters to you.</p></div><ol class="roadmap-preview"><li><span>01</span><strong>Margin</strong></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Strategy</strong></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Growth</strong></li><li><span>04</span><strong>Freedom</strong></li><li><span>05</span><strong>Impact</strong></li></ol><a class="text-link" href="/financial-freedom/">Explore the path to financial freedom →</a></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BUILD</div><h2>Your career or your business gives you control over your income.<br><span class="athlete-gold">Your investment business gives you control over your future.</span></h2><div class="manifesto-grid"><p class="lead">You would never run your operating company the way most people run their investment portfolios. No hiring plan, no performance metrics, no clarity on what each department is supposed to produce.</p><div><p>An investment business runs alongside what you already do. The aim is to get your money working harder for you than you worked to earn it.</p><p>The idea is the same whether your income comes from a company, a career, or a sport.</p></div></div></div></section>





<section class="section questions approach-light"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE RIPL APPROACH</div><div class="questions-head"><h2>Clarity before<br>the next decision.</h2><p>Most advisors start with your assets. We start with your life. That one difference changes every decision that follows.</p></div><div class="pillar-grid"><a class="pillar" href="/how-we-work/"><span class="num">01 / CLARITY</span><h3>We turn complexity to clarity.</h3><p>Money is a tool, not an asset. When you are clear on what you want that tool to build, every decision that follows gets easier.</p><span class="pillar-link">Explore SAGE™ Planning</span></a><a class="pillar" href="/wealth/"><span class="num">02 / TIMING</span><h3>We redefine risk.</h3><p>Risk is not volatility. Risk is your money not being ready when you are.</p><span class="pillar-link">Explore RIPL Portfolios</span></a><a class="pillar" href="/wealth/#investment-tools"><span class="num">03 / CHOICE</span><h3>We expand your toolbox.</h3><p>We give you access to tools most investors never see and most advisors never use. Every decision stays exactly where it belongs. With you.</p><span class="pillar-link">Explore Investment Tools</span></a></div></div></section>




<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">TWO WAYS TO WORK WITH US</div><h2>You choose one of two paths.</h2>
  <div class="two-paths"><a class="card" href="/how-we-work/?path=pm#client-path"><h3>RIPL Portfolios</h3><p>For those seeking an upgrade to their investment structure.</p></a><a class="card" href="/how-we-work/?path=both#client-path"><h3>SAGE™ + RIPL Portfolios</h3><p>For those seeking full financial clarity and a revitalized portfolio structure.</p></a></div>
  <div class="cta"><a class="btn ghost" href="/how-we-work/">See How We Work</a></div>
</div></section>






